{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3730,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","line":6367,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[Pseudo-Riemannian Adapted Orthonormal Frames]\n\\label{prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-riemannian-metric, def:induced-tensor-along-map, lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle, prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian, lem:extend-nondegenerate-family, prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family, lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate, lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.72}\n\nIf $F:M\\to(\\bar M,\\bar g)$ presents a pseudo-Riemannian or Riemannian submanifold with induced $g$, then every $p\\in M$ has a neighborhood with an orthonormal frame of $F^*T\\bar M$ whose first $n=\\dim M$ members span $dF_x(T_xM)$ at every $x$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map,lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle,prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian,lem:extend-nondegenerate-family,prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family,lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate,lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\\sketch Equip $F^*T\\bar M$ with Lemma \\ref{lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle}; Lemma \\ref{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion} gives injectivity. Push forward a local orthonormal frame of $(M,g)$ from Proposition \\ref{prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian}; inducedness makes it orthonormal and Lemma \\ref{lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate} makes it nondegenerate. Extend by Lemma \\ref{lem:extend-nondegenerate-family}, orthonormalize by Proposition \\ref{prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family}, and use preservation of the span flag plus dimension $n$ to obtain adaptedness.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[Pseudo-Riemannian Adapted Orthonormal Frames] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a70736575646f2d7269656d616e6e69616e2d616461707465642d6672616d65\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-riemannian-metric\">↗ def:pseudo-riemannian-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-pseudo-metric-bundle\">↗ lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aorthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian\">↗ prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aextend-nondegenerate-family\">↗ lem:extend-nondegenerate-family</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aorthonormalize-nondegenerate-family\">↗ prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate\">↗ lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\">↗ lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.72</span></span><p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F:M\\to (\\bar M,\\bar g)$\">$F:M\\to (\\bar M,\\bar g)$</span> presents a pseudo-Riemannian or Riemannian submanifold with induced <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span>, then every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p\\in M$\">$p\\in M$</span> has a neighborhood with an orthonormal frame of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F^*T\\bar M$\">$F^*T\\bar M$</span> whose first <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n=\\dim M$\">$n=\\dim M$</span> members span <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dF_x(T_xM)$\">$dF_x(T_xM)$</span> at every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-pseudo-metric-bundle\">↗ lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aorthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian\">↗ prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aextend-nondegenerate-family\">↗ lem:extend-nondegenerate-family</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aorthonormalize-nondegenerate-family\">↗ prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate\">↗ lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\">↗ lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion</a> \\sketch Equip <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F^*T\\bar M$\">$F^*T\\bar M$</span> with Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-pseudo-metric-bundle\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70756c6c6261636b2d70736575646f2d6d65747269632d62756e646c65\">17</a>; Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d7375626d616e69666f6c642d696d6d657273696f6e\">17</a> gives injectivity. Push forward a local orthonormal frame of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(M,g)$\">$(M,g)$</span> from Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aorthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a6f7274686f6e6f726d616c2d6672616d65732d70736575646f2d7269656d616e6e69616e\">16.3</a>; inducedness makes it orthonormal and Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6f7274686f6e6f726d616c2d7475706c652d6e6f6e646567656e6572617465\">16.3</a> makes it nondegenerate. Extend by Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aextend-nondegenerate-family\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a657874656e642d6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d66616d696c79\">17</a>, orthonormalize by Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aorthonormalize-nondegenerate-family\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a6f7274686f6e6f726d616c697a652d6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d66616d696c79\">16.3</a>, and use preservation of the span flag plus dimension <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span> to obtain adaptedness. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","title":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","label":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","label":"def:induced-tensor-along-map"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle","title":"lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle","label":"lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian","title":"prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian","label":"prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","title":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","label":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family","title":"prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family","label":"prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate","title":"lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate","label":"lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","label":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-frame","title":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-frame","label":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-frame"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#cor:normal-bundle-pseudo-riemannian-submanifold","title":"cor:normal-bundle-pseudo-riemannian-submanifold","label":"cor:normal-bundle-pseudo-riemannian-submanifold"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[Pseudo-Riemannian Adapted Orthonormal Frames]\n\\label{prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-riemannian-metric, def:induced-tensor-along-map, lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle, prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian, lem:extend-nondegenerate-family, prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family, lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate, lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.72}\n\nIf $F:M\\to(\\bar M,\\bar g)$ presents a pseudo-Riemannian or Riemannian submanifold with induced $g$, then every $p\\in M$ has a neighborhood with an orthonormal frame of $F^*T\\bar M$ whose first $n=\\dim M$ members span $dF_x(T_xM)$ at every $x$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map,lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle,prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian,lem:extend-nondegenerate-family,prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family,lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate,lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\\sketch Equip $F^*T\\bar M$ with Lemma \\ref{lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle}; Lemma \\ref{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion} gives injectivity. Push forward a local orthonormal frame of $(M,g)$ from Proposition \\ref{prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian}; inducedness makes it orthonormal and Lemma \\ref{lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate} makes it nondegenerate. Extend by Lemma \\ref{lem:extend-nondegenerate-family}, orthonormalize by Proposition \\ref{prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family}, and use preservation of the span flag plus dimension $n$ to obtain adaptedness.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","title":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle","title":"lem:pullback-pseudo-metric-bundle","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian","title":"prop:orthonormal-frames-pseudo-riemannian","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","title":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family","title":"prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate","title":"lem:orthonormal-tuple-nondegenerate","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}